{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"8b53995adce355eb21e38d42218f3d5abf0bc09a1451646f7bf2a2c468801578","ja":"全力だけど","zh":"全力以赴，却……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"03a1f42602dce75a8ba6706240f183b93e152ac547db68bca1c9f51eff3c6d34","ja":"「はい、それじゃあ第二幕。\nホシピッピの登場シーンからお願いします！」","zh":"「好的，那么第二幕。\n请从星噼噼登场的场景开始！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"837787bc7a637659bd2273bcaef4cb746afcd14dad2e73c4602261023d974ef4","ja":"「ピピ～ッ！　迷える電波をピピピと受信っピ！\n夜空からは、な～んでも丸見えっピよ～！」","zh":"“哔哔～！哔哔哔地接收到了迷茫的电波哔！\n从夜空看过去，可～是什么都看得一清二楚哔～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1896c04a0d874a33acf76fd522a9a8fd561b0a670253b676f49e0404ef8e3445","ja":"「星の妖精、ホシピッピが助けに来たっピ～！\nピピッ！　ピピピのピ～～～～ッ！」","zh":"“星星妖精星皮皮来帮忙哔～！\n哔哔！哔哔哔之哔～～～～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b1715ab7af2eaba93aea3249402eccac0b613cb69237d438a38ae0c877918afc","ja":"「いいですね！　次は途中でターンする\nパターンも試してもらえますか？」","zh":"“很不错呢！接下来能试一下中途转身\n的动作吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bcef5ed609495a9d9076e83ae83a9320b7d6a39e452c661683454d7392111fc7","ja":"は～い♪　わかりました～！","zh":"好～的♪我知道啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c0c9c0a51d4af40d8ba86cc0d5b0c4ee9056e658e4759eff59cb5d2f07671f72","ja":"わぁ～っ♪","zh":"哇～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f3c8a9477ee517288ce07edb5d8492aaf797692704276412b026e5c373f51ba1","ja":"（えっ！？\nなっ、なんで春香がここにいるのよ～！？）","zh":"（咦！？\n为、为什么春香会在这里啊～！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"16090edd49119ed19d36e8e67ba39404d5aa1c76d57f63dd118ebfce0f072b7a","ja":"お疲れさま～！　あのね、台本を届けにきたら、\nスタッフさんが、どうぞって通してくれたんだ。","zh":"辛苦啦～！那个呀，我来送剧本的时候，\n工作人员就让我进来了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"08d9b2fdae682b0f4cc24b049098dab39677574f945e473c1d87dd9448614355","ja":"そ、そう……ありがと。\nあの、春香、この舞台のことなんだけど……。","zh":"这、这样啊……谢谢你。\n那个，春香，关于这个舞台……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"64b37d32c8b67fd3cdabf228024455d61f8e426dfb6bf8bb26d9787c17f71693","ja":"その……衣装が星の着ぐるみになるし、\nこれからは、忘れ物は届けてくれなくても……。","zh":"那个……演出服装会变成星星玩偶装，\n所以今后，就算有遗落的东西也不用帮我送过来了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"eb8b6e43de427576d2593e0f91086f82d014dacefe6d5ba291fb455e9d214fa5","ja":"へ～、変わった衣装なんだね。","zh":"诶～，这服装挺特别的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e6358f7ea2fb82c7aac6515b7f3c5298def8b63135970266ee40cdb68a855fac","ja":"あっ、だから、そのイメージに合わせて、\nいつもと違った声でしゃべってたんだ～！","zh":"啊，所以你才配合那个形象，\n用平时不一样的声音说话的呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"93813322859ad37f25bcfb725c31cfe8c7abdce315baf217a7b9a613f0e2e425","ja":"そ、そうなの。だから、あんまり見られたくは……。","zh":"是、是啊。所以，不太想被人看见……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"889524fd864380930077720c71bbcb65b71b123f3f13e91a1e0e0385621e5e2a","ja":"難しそうな役なのに、\nしっかり役作りしててすごいね！","zh":"明明是个看起来挺难的角色，\n却能把人物塑造得这么到位，真厉害呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"36a91700902198a5c03c0847a5b6de0c837153199f442d88e97773c6dc46b6fb","ja":"ま、まあ、当然よ！　どんなお仕事だって、\n伊織ちゃんは全力で挑むんだから！","zh":"那、那是当然的啦！无论是什么工作，\n伊织都会全力以赴的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"3a4989acafcd7f363b5ea10a9fb750f6e9685899eb49865c785a771c4f2ab9c5","ja":"さすが伊織！　本番、絶対に見に行くね！\nそうだ、今のうちに劇場のみんなにも連絡しとこっと♪","zh":"真不愧是伊织！正式演出时我一定会去看的！\n对啦，趁现在跟剧场的大家也联系一下吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"aca6514a70a70bccc95460a19975c08c0c1e56507c8e9b1285a79aeafa41d28e","ja":"みんな！？　ちょ、ちょっと待って！\nそれはさすがに恥ずか……。","zh":"大家！？等、等等！\n那样未免也太让人不好意……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1492.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"7725de52859c5dee10062d984391108b84d127e8ba783d24aaa9ce9b856b0eda","ja":"だ、ダメ～～ッ！","zh":"不、不行～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
